WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.130
- Well, when you're not
in Big Sky, how do you,

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:02.963
'cause we just moved here,

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.300
how do you like wind down here?

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.000
- Do you like to sweat?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.910
- Um, I like hiking, if
that's where you're going.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:08.743
- No.
- Oh, okay.

00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:09.710
- No, this is--

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.520
- If you're going like spinning, I'm out.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.353
- No, not spinning.

00:00:12.353 --> 00:00:13.760
You lay on a table.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.593
- [Kelly] I'm in.

00:00:14.593 --> 00:00:16.044
- It's like an urban (laughing)--

00:00:16.044 --> 00:00:17.320
- Yeah, I'm in.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.270
- It's an urban sweat lodge.
- What?

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.103
- You lay on a table.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.320
They wrap you like a burrito.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.153
It heats up.

00:00:22.153 --> 00:00:23.330
They put headphones on.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.920
You can watch Amazon, Hulu, Netflix.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.370
They bring you water.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.750
- Okay, you're just sweating out toxins,

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.583
listening to music or a movie.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:31.240
- Yes, and your heart rate
goes up and you burn calories,

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.644
laying there watching TV. (laughing)

00:00:33.644 --> 00:00:34.811
- We found it!

00:00:35.722 --> 00:00:37.472
We found the miracle.

